ocial-share-label"}>{"Share"}</span><ul className={"social-list"} role={"list"}><li><button type={"button"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft"} {...{"x-bind:aria-label": "copied ? 'Link copied' : 'Copy link'"}} aria-label={"Copy link"} {...{"x-on:click": "navigator.clipboard?.writeText(location.href); copied = true; setTimeout(() => copied = false, 1800)"}}><i className={"ph ph-link"} x-show={"!copied"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><i className={"ph ph-check"} x-show={"copied"} x-cloak={""} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></button></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"x"} aria-label={"Share on X"}><i className={"ph ph-x-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"linkedin"} aria-label={"Share on LinkedIn"}><i className={"ph ph-linkedin-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"facebook"} aria-label={"Share on Facebook"}><i className={"ph ph-facebook-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft"} aria-label={"Share by email"}><i className={"ph ph-envelope-simple"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li></ul></div></div></div><figure className={"mx-auto mt-[clamp(2.5rem,2rem+2vw,4rem)] mb-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/2000x1500.svg"} alt={"A linen-covered table by an open kitchen window with a sourdough loaf, a bowl of figs and a moka pot in morning sun"} width={"2000"} height={"1500"} fetchPriority={"high"} decoding={"async"} className={"aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover object-[50%_65%]"} /><figcaption className={"mt-4 text-center text-base text-muted"}>{"The table at 7 a.m., before it turns back into a table."}</figcaption></figure></div></section><section className={"pt-[clamp(3rem,2rem+3vw,5rem)] pb-(--section-space)"}><div className={"container"}><article className={"article-body article-body--flush custom-article mx-auto max-w-[44rem]"}><p className={"drop-cap"}>{"For four years I had a desk. It was a good desk, oak, from a house clearance in Leith, and it sat in the corner of the bedroom facing a wall. I wrote almost nothing at it. I wrote the letters, all of them, at the kitchen table, with the kettle in reach and the window to my left."}</p><p>{"In January I gave the desk to a friend who has a garden shed and a novel to finish. The bedroom got its corner back. I got permission, finally, to stop pretending."}</p><h2>{"One table, three jobs"}</h2><p>{"The table is 140 centimeters long and does three things a day. Breakfast until eight. Work until one. Dinner from seven. The trick is that each job ends with the table cleared, so the next one starts from nothing. It takes four minutes, and it is the closest thing I have to a commute."}</p><p>{"Clearing is the whole system. If I leave the laptop out over lunch, I eat lunch at work. If the bread board stays out past nine, the morning never quite starts."}</p><blockquote>{"\n                            A desk tells you to work. A table asks what you would like to do next.\n                            "}<cite>{"From my notebook, January"}</cite></blockquote><h2>{"What lives in the drawer"}</h2><p>{"The table has one shallow drawer, and everything I need to work fits in it. That is the rule: if it does not fit, it does not stay."}</p><ul><li><strong>{"One notebook"}</strong>{" for drafts, numbered on the spine. I am on number 31."}</li><li><strong>{"Two pencils and one pen"}</strong>{", the pen a fountain pen I am trying, slowly, to deserve."}</li><li><strong>{"Index cards"}</strong>{" for recipe tests: weights on the front, what went wrong on the back."}</li><li><strong>{"The laptop and its charger"}</strong>{", which go in last and come out first."}</li></ul><div className={"custom-gallery not-prose grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"}><a href={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} className={"glightbox custom-feed"} data-gallery={"bl1-article"} data-glightbox={"description: The drawer: a notebook, pencils, one pen, index cards."} aria-label={"Open photo: the drawer"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} alt={"An open wooden drawer holding a notebook, pencils, a fountain pen and index cards"} width={"1002"} height={"1002"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></a><a href={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} className={"glightbox custom-feed"} data-gallery={"bl1-article"} data-glightbox={"description: Seven o'clock, laptop still shut."} aria-label={"Open photo: the table at dawn"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} alt={"A closed laptop, a teapot and a cup on the kitchen table in blue dawn light"} width={"1002"} height={"1002"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></a><a href={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} className={"glightbox custom-feed max-sm:col-span-2"} data-gallery={"bl1-article"} data-glightbox={"description: First drafts are always by hand."} aria-label={"Open photo: writing by hand"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1002x1002.svg"} alt={"Hands writing in a notebook at the kitchen table beside a cup of tea"} width={"1002"} height={"1002"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></a></div><p className={"custom-caption"}>{"The drawer, the table at seven, and the first draft of this letter."}</p><h2>{"The 7 a.m. hour"}</h2><p>{"Most of what you read here is written between seven and eight, before email, with the second cup of tea. One hour is not much. But it is an hour nobody else wants, and after six years